  <p class="note-line">
    PLFS figures are for formal work only, ages 21 to 34, calendar year 2025, with an entry sample of 182 engineers. The analysis notes that the survey's standard errors are understated, so read them as point estimates. Wages are nominal for one year. The PayScale figure is total pay from a self-reported site and is a different measure.
  </p>

  <h2 id="spread">The honest spread: median versus top</h2>

  <p>
    The top number is real. It also describes a small group. Here are three ways to see the distance between the middle and the top.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
