  <h2 id="stack">What lifts a person from the median band to the top band</h2>

  <p>
    The pattern across routes is the same. We call it core plus multiplier plus proof. One strong core skill, one multiplier skill that makes the core more valuable, and visible proof that a stranger can check.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>This stack is your high-income skill portfolio.</strong> Clear communication in English and in your home language is the multiplier almost every row needs, and a few people who know your work will do more for your pay than a hundred cold applications.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Route</th>
          <th>Core skill</th>
          <th>Multiplier skill</th>
          <th>Proof that counts</th>
          <th>The jump</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {stackRows.map((r) => (
