            <td data-label="The jump">{r.jump}</td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p>
    Test the stack with The 3 Gates before you pay for more learning. Start with free material such as YouTube courses, open courseware and official documentation, and judge a paid course by its syllabus, recent updates and learner outcomes, not by its platform name. A pile of certificates is not proof.
  </p>

  <div class="gates-block">
