  <h2 id="sales">How a PCM graduate gets paid more: the basic sales and marketing layer</h2>

  <p>
    Every route has a "who pays, and how do they find and trust you" layer. Most students are never taught it. Here it is in plain words, with no promise of income.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Route</th>
          <th>Who pays</th>
          <th>How they find and trust you</th>
