        </ul>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="note-line">
    A capped ladder is not a bad choice. A stable post with a published scale suits some families well, and saving and investing can still build wealth. Just plan a second skill that can grow on its own.
  </p>

  <h2 id="stages">Competition at more than one stage</h2>

  <p>
    A path can clear one hard filter and meet another. The pay you read about usually sits after the last one.
  </p>

