  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI by route: where it multiplies pay and where it eats the entry job</h2>

  <p>
    AI changes the task mix before it changes titles. The useful question for each route is which part gets easier and which human layer keeps its value. Use the Survival check of The 4-Checkpoint Protocol (Biology, Context, Market and Survival): is the work still needed when the tools improve?
  </p>

